      "id": "claim_11517f4004d84d74a9aa5799a8d72849",
      "statement": "All curated tool modules live flat under agent/tools/ and are re-exported through agent/tools/__init__.py, which lazily imports and caches each export from _TOOL_MODULES; its custom _LazyToolsModule prevents same-named imported submodules from shadowing public tool exports.",
